"3. Press and hold in the [FW] key while turning the radio on\n"
"     (\"CLONE\" will appear on the display).\n"
"4. Press the [MODE] key (\"-WAIT-\" will appear on the LCD).\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 無線機の電源をオフ\n"
