"     (ディスプレイに \"CLONE\" と表示されます)。\n"
"4. [MODE] キーを押します (LCDに \"-WAIT-\" と表示されます)。\n"

#: ../drivers/ft7800.py:320
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable to DATA jack.\n"
"3. Press and hold in the [MHz(PRI)] key while turning the\n"
"     radio on.\n"
"4. Rotate the DIAL job to select \"F-7 CLONE\".\n"
"5. Press and hold in the [BAND(SET)] key. The display\n"
"     will disappear for a moment, then the \"CLONE\" notation\n"
"     will appear.\n"
"6. Press the [LOW(ACC)] key (\"--RX--\" will appear on the display).\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 無線機の電源をオフ\n"
"2. ケーブルをDATAジャックに接続\n"
"3. [MHz(PRI)] キーを押しながら無線機の電源をオン\n"
"4. DIALノブを回して \"F-7 CLONE\" を選択\n"
"5. [BAND(SET)] キーを長押し。ディスプレイが一瞬消え、\n"
"     その後 \"CLONE\" 表記が現れます。\n"
"6. [LOW(ACC)] キーを押します (ディスプレイに \"--RX--\" と表示されます)。\n"

#: ../drivers/ft7800.py:309
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable to DATA jack.\n"
"3. Press and hold in the [MHz(PRI)] key while turning the\n"
" radio on.\n"
"4. Rotate the DIAL job to select \"F-7 CLONE\".\n"
"5. Press and hold in the [BAND(SET)] key. The display\n"
" will disappear for a moment, then the \"CLONE\" notation\n"
" will appear.\n"
"6. <b>After clicking OK</b>, press the [V/M(MW)] key to send image.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 無線機の電源をオフ\n"
"2. ケーブルをDATAジャックに接続\n"
"3. [MHz(PRI)] キーを押しながら無線機の電源をオン\n"
"4. DIALノブを回して \"F-7 CLONE\" を選択\n"
"5. [BAND(SET)] キーを長押し。ディスプレイが一瞬消え、\n"
"     その後 \"CLONE\" 表記が現れます。\n"
"6. <b>OKをクリックした後</b>、[V/M(MW)] キーを押してイメージを送信\n"

#: ../drivers/ft2d.py:90
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable to DATA terminal.\n"
"3. Press and hold [DISP] key while turning on radio\n"
"     (\"CLONE\" will appear on radio LCD).\n"
"4. <b>After clicking OK here in Chirp</b>,\n"
"     press the [Send] screen button.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 無線機の電源をオフ\n"
"2. ケーブルをDATA端子に接続\n"
"3. [DISP] キーを押しながら無線機の電源をオン\n"
"     (無線機LCDに \"CLONE\" と表示されます)。\n"
"4. <b>CHIRPでOKをクリックした後</b>、\n"
"     [Send] スクリーンボタンを押してください。\n"

#: ../drivers/ft2d.py:97
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable to DATA terminal.\n"
"3. Press and hold in [DISP] key while turning on radio\n"
"     (\"CLONE\" will appear on radio LCD).\n"
"4. Press [RECEIVE] screen button\n"
"     (\"-WAIT-\" will appear on radio LCD).\n"
"5. Finally, press OK button below.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 無線機の電源をオフ\n"
"2. ケーブルをDATA端子に接続\n"
"3. [DISP] キーを押しながら無線機の電源をオン\n"
"     (無線機LCDに \"CLONE\" と表示されます)。\n"
"4. [RECEIVE] スクリーンボタンを押してください\n"
"     (無線機LCDに \"-WAIT-\" と表示されます)。\n"
"5. 最後に、下のOKボタンを押してください。\n"

#: ../drivers/ft1d.py:902
msgid ""
"1. Turn radio off.\n"
"2. Connect cable to DATA terminal.\n"
"3. Press and hold in the [F] key while turning the radio on\n"
"     (\"CLONE\" will appear on the display).\n"
"4. <b>After clicking OK</b>, press the [BAND] key to send image.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 無線機の電源をオフ\n"
