msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:1959
msgid "Sets how often the signal strength display is updated while receiving. If weak signals pick up noise because it updates too often, increase this interval."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:1816 ../drivers/baofeng_uv17Pro.py:666
msgid "Sets how strong a received signal must be before the speaker unmutes. 0 leaves the squelch open so you hear noise all the time, higher values reject more weak signals and noise. Raise this value if the speaker keeps unmuting on interference, lower it if distant stations are being cut off."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/ft450d.py:995
msgid "Sets how strongly the contour filter boosts or cuts. Low gives a gentle effect, High a stronger one."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/ft450d.py:1467
msgid "Sets the CW sidetone volume, from 0 to 100, used when CW sidetone volume Linked is off."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:2380
msgid "Sets the DTMF code that kills this radio when another radio sends it. A killed radio does not work until it receives the Remote Wake code."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:2405
msgid "Sets the DTMF code that makes this radio transmit for 60 seconds when another radio sends it, so that the other station can listen to what is happening around this radio."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:2392
msgid "Sets the DTMF code that restores this radio after it has been stunned or killed. Set it before anyone uses the stun or kill codes, because without it the radio cannot be restored."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:2367
msgid "Sets the DTMF code that stuns this radio when another radio sends it. A stunned radio can still receive, but cannot transmit or be operated from the keypad."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:2593
msgid "Sets the SSID added to the call sign, which tells other stations what kind of station this is."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/ft450d.py:1768
msgid "Sets the VOX sensitivity used in DIG mode, so that the audio from the data equipment switches the transmitter on without a PTT line. 0 turns VOX off in DIG mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:1868 ../drivers/baofeng_uv17Pro.py:1041
msgid "Sets the VOX sensitivity. Too sensitive a setting keys the transmitter on the noise around the radio, too insensitive a setting fails to pick up your voice."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/ft450d.py:1759
msgid "Sets the VOX sensitivity. Too sensitive a setting keys the transmitter on the noise around the radio, too insensitive a setting fails to pick up your voice. 1 is the least sensitive setting and 100 the most."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:1919 ../drivers/radtel_rt880g.py:1935
#, python-format
msgid "Sets the audio DAC gain in %s mode, from 0 to 15. Lower it if the received audio sounds distorted."
msgstr ""

#: ../drivers/ft450d.py:1304
msgid "Sets the baud rate of the CAT jack, which must match the computer control software. Data turns the CAT jack into an RTTY interface instead: RTTY software keys the FSK shift through the serial data input and uses RTS as PTT."
